{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c387821b0576638446c7c1340b2a33f10410bc20bccde069d9ae6a1bba0f63f", "ja": "（初ステージも無事に終わり、ロコはやる気一杯だ。\n今日はテレビ局で、初めての挨拶回りだけど……）", "zh": "（初次舞台演出也顺利结束了，ROCO干劲十足。今天要去电视台进行第一次问候，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "87f0523c1f1edcca66748f3617db21b3dc502aa6893c57698bdf8e399995a12a", "ja": "ふむふむ。さすが、TVステーションですね！　ロコ\nのイマジネーションを刺激するもので、いっぱいです♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，真不愧是电视台！这里到处都是能刺激ROCO想象力的东西♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7292b824840abe522225590cac3ceabfba0f999df1be5a5280928e9182439482", "ja": "興味があるなら、あとでスタジオ見学させて\nもらおうか。でもまずは、先に挨拶を……あれ？", "zh": "如果你感兴趣，待会儿要不要让你参观一下摄影棚？不过首先还是先去打个招呼……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "38f5d44d1455ecf573239459bdc3e8780661339ce977e4a3472ffc167c735e35", "ja": "あの！　このデコレーションは、もっとビビッドな\nカラーでペイントしたほうがグッドだと思いますよ！", "zh": "那个！我觉得这个装饰用更鲜艳的颜色来涂会更好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1004_staff", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bf415c23b06950635140c9cba4def55da9227d14c62ce0f2651963e335ae64d1", "ja": "あっ、す、すみません！　ロコ、ダメだろ、仕事中に\n話しかけちゃ……スタッフさんが驚いてるじゃないか。", "zh": "啊，不、对不起！ROCO，我真是的，工作时间不该跟你搭话……工作人员都被吓到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "846aabab5d3be136c839925ed29502c5334080949755d84e1e4a81712a51ba77", "ja": "そのほうがモアベターです！　パステルカラーじゃ\nせっかくのユニークなデザインが目立ちませんし……", "zh": "这样才更棒！要是用粉彩色，难得的独特设计就不显眼了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "01e5d9c1bb8b9a1f1934d324859622e0000d2d56b3bfdfd5991dca8e59409ea3", "ja": "あっ！　あれを見てください！", "zh": "啊！请看那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3edf3eaee045e939fc9d5614fd48a4279958136c5f9f094a7b8b097b3e0c6d3f", "ja": "今度は何だ？", "zh": "这次又是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "c8f2286d1000d74f62ae329dd6786f22b188abc0c2c85826ae1041259f8fe39a", "ja": "{$P$}！\nこのバックグラウンドも、インコンプリートです！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n这个背景也还不完整！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "3f5cece56479b58ec2eb366d5107d5e0ad965178bd5a2b86373da9a9cf500ae6", "ja": "これでは、センターのアニマルたちが\nブラインドされてしまいます～！", "zh": "这样一来，正中央的动物们就要被挡住了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1011_staff", "source_sha256": "8eb8b4ce2697f197cb85d6eee5b9b6fa0e12f32e0b2b788371b0f0bbef43cbb8", "ja": "な、なんだこの子は？", "zh": "这、这孩子是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1012_p", "source_sha256": "64fb582737158cbf96419f741ee3560c6192f522628d3410f97c8185fff07582", "ja": "すみません、その背景セットが気になるみたいで……\nそうだよな、ロコ？", "zh": "不好意思，它好像对那套背景很感兴趣……\n对吧，ROCO？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "ff7f14ea424b504f7ea7f1b3bad08799a6dbfbe9328b0af112561e4f0224003b", "ja": "はい！　これは、カラーチェンジがネセサリーですよ。\nカラーは……あっ、ブラシ借りますね♪", "zh": "没错！这个需要换个颜色才行。\n颜色是……啊，我借用一下刷子哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "d316f2b8fdcd8d018c5abbc92746d65ac4f92f8e94f6305a4fc42bcd04b54cd1", "ja": "えーと、こうしてこうして……ペタペタ……\nうん、これでフィニッシュですよ！", "zh": "呃……这样，再这样……拍拍……\n嗯，这样就完成啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1015_staff", "source_sha256": "e0a205b882a308c018e5212f451b7667d1199bedf21ab653e3bb87ac338b811a", "ja": "おお……！？　さっきより、断然見栄えがよくなった！\nありがとう、君は……新しいアルバイトさんかな？", "zh": "哦……！？比刚才好看多了！\n谢谢，你是……新来的兼职吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "20099097c79a10003264efbd974f5edec620b87546833068657508f1384c9dde", "ja": "違います！\nロコは765プロのニューアイドル、ロコです！", "zh": "不是！我是ROCO的第765位新人偶像，ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1017_staff", "source_sha256": "28dcd27add4044fa1bf68ff218f43b022c8f4fd59d20898fb52531fa181fce25", "ja": "ロコちゃんか！　手伝ってくれてありがとう。\nまた何か気づいた事があったら、アドバイス頼むよ！", "zh": "原来是ROCO啊！谢谢你帮忙。\n要是之后又发现了什么，也拜托你给我提提建议啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "634060234c2b88d80d2544117e1975810e6eb2dc3ab4f7fa7a55632deb8bd04c", "ja": "オフコースです♪\nいつでも、ロコに聞いてくださいね！", "zh": "当然可以♪\n随时都可以来问ROCO哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fd29ce6dc2411ccb138c4bd06279daf55d095d4b922823cf0f0ce9a812a4f6dc", "ja": "（おお！　スタッフさんに名前を覚えてもらったぞ。\n思わぬところで、ロコのアピールになったな）", "zh": "（哦！工作人员记住我的名字了。\n真没想到会在这种地方为ROCO做宣传啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1020_null", "source_sha256": "370f4379b4697b0e0daa191ecd520fcc8fef36ceb6513a8255a1dae142d646cd", "ja": "挨拶回り終了後……", "zh": "问候拜访结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "1a4d93d64078575697fc9c20a822a51d540b82dce85948dc6f6d2c7a4aac1ef0", "ja": "ふぅ。TVステーション、エンジョイしましたね！\nホットでエキサイティングなスポットでした♪", "zh": "呼……电视台之旅真是享受啊！\n真是个火热又刺激的地方呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1022_p", "source_sha256": "04d1e3c42a4072c0aaaba44d7fca3ea30c2e9d5c127fedd6984328fbc2ceb579", "ja": "はは、そうか。それにしても、アートが得意なのは\n知ってたけど……ロコは、色々な事ができるんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。不过，我知道你擅长艺术……没想到ROCO还真是什么都会啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "f227b5a34572dfb4955501d7942a054e8c443eeeeef091911cf024606a70d9e1", "ja": "えへへ、まかせてください！　ロコは毎日、\nアートをエクスプレッションしてますから♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，交给我吧！ROCO每天都在表达艺术嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "2d246bcbf40545d7b381203b61d9f9e420d9c3356c7809348a7affc8942a0047", "ja": "アートはグローバルなコミュニケーションツールです。\nアウトプットが、インポータントなんですよ！", "zh": "艺术是全球通用的交流工具。\n表达成果非常重要哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6dc1845a1e96e1ce96b9a8718921b502c1c78dc4cfcdb2ba3614ae7a4a6bbcab", "ja": "な、なるほど。\n……そういえば、ロコは言葉も個性的だな？", "zh": "啊、原来如此。  \n……这么说来，ROCO说话也很有个性啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "5188bdef9de2969beaada206fad0f0e683e22eafa486ef5bf3d0b952c0bcbb40", "ja": "はい♪\nロコナイズした言葉も、アートの一部ですからね。", "zh": "是的♪\n经过ROCO化的语言，也是艺术的一部分嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "8a5429669358215200691b55da799178bd2c4be9a96bfd8037da13243fa19b13", "ja": "ロコが使う言葉は、ロコがセレクトします。\nこれも、ロコのアイデンティティーです！", "zh": "ROCO使用的词语，都是由ROCO精心挑选的。\n这也是ROCO的个性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "816a6c7b7ba248f40054c70b8b3d5c9f9895c4d2ae24132fbfb309bda1547bd4", "ja": "そうか、しっかり選んで使ってるんだな。\nちなみに、家でもそんな風に喋るのか？", "zh": "这样啊，你都是经过认真挑选后才使用的啊。顺便问一下，你在家里也会这么说话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "e9a5e44e24580ee4e85f7d0296648f3b12573b418d8cec9753ae38dac13ace13", "ja": "も……もちろんです。\nロコナイズにインターバルはありません！", "zh": "当……当然了。  \nROCO化没有间歇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "fcfdcdb4793a3bced7678f6b1174458c84808e4e76208fa8b45e02eab84d18ed", "ja": "それに、これはロコズファミリーをリスペクトした\nコンセンサスでもあるんですよ。", "zh": "而且，这也是尊重ROCO家族的共识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d41445f242e85fb82cc2b856f5662c3980480ce1870a6e00ffd5cf766c2395d9", "ja": "ファミリーをリスペクト……そうか。\nロコは、家族の事を尊敬しているんだな。", "zh": "尊重家人……这样啊。\nROCO很尊敬自己的家人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "1de70f8deb78b79384622d9303e2d0284808ca05e293d2d5f762bbc6d79afd01", "ja": "はい！　ロコズファミリーは、みんなアートで\nセルフエクスプレッションしてるんです。", "zh": "是的！ROCO一家的人都在用艺术表达自我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c76bfd7901fdb6807b8a2716d2cd8e03c450abb9f0bf0a9363413f1a87050b4f", "ja": "そうなのか。\n家族の人達は、どんなアートが専門なんだ？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n你的家人们分别擅长什么艺术？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1034_025roc", "source_sha256": "6ced8fde1265075e7dda609dd8d23cbfc77513baf6c028d501c70a29141922b8", "ja": "ええと……オイルペインター、インテリアデザイナー。\nファッションデザイナー、スペースデザイナーです♪", "zh": "那个……油画家、室内设计师。\n时装设计师、空间设计师♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1035_025roc", "source_sha256": "bad240b8e4b35b951e77dae5d435ff5d8ccdb845f371bd70a195d4a2612e264a", "ja": "フィールドはそれぞれ違いますけど、\nロコはファミリーをリスペクトしてます！", "zh": "虽然各自的领域不同，但ROCO很尊重这个家族！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_004_1036_p", "source_sha256": "06cda96172a5794b1d5ec1e919a6034767157a1994873402285a744d4680b6fe", "ja": "（芸術一家か……ロコの「個性的である事が当たり前」\nという考え方は、その影響なんだろうな）", "zh": "（艺术世家吗……ROCO那种“个性与众不同是理所当然”的想法，应该就是受此影响吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
